cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "Resource Efficient, Multi-Method Explainable AI for Brain Tumor Segmentation with Cross-Population Validation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a CPU-only explainable AI framework for
  three-dimensional brain tumor segmentation, with multi-method gradient
  attribution, deployment-consistency verification, exact training-free pruning
  of an inactive network stage, and external cross-population evaluation.
type: software
license: MIT
